{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>This game is &quot;Safe For Work&quot;, generally rated as ages 13+! While there is a theme of Spankin', it's all in fun, get your mind out of the gutter!</i></strong><i><br><br>Rescue your game from a hungry virus named Spunk in this narrative driven exploration game! Befriend or destroy him, tackle challenges and minigames, uncover secrets, unlock customizations, and explore different endings. With GlitchSPANKR's antivirus software every level is different and unexpected!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>OVERVIEW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a 12 year old gamer in the 90's, your curiosity was ignited when your Mom brought home a new game you weren't allowed to play. Big Booty Slapper 6. Unfortunately, there seems to be a rogue virus eating and corrupting your precious game! Using the GlitchSPANKR Antivirus software, dive into virtual worlds and Spank that Glitch! Or befriend him. Or spare his poor, ugly, miserable life. Maybe give him a smooch... fall in love... Oh, uhem. Well there are a lot of options. Just... get in there and figure it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/Physics.png?t=1742387328\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/SpankinGIFHD.gif?t=1742387328\" />Physics based Spankin' and Destructin', learn the art of Spank-fu! Almost everything is breakable or interactable. Is your spanking hand wet? Dry it with an air blower! Spanking hand on fire? Well that sucks. Don't like that light? Break the gosh darn thing and live in the dark! Hate that talking toilet that's eating your game? Spank the vile beast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/Path.png?t=1742387328\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/ChoicesGIFHD.gif?t=1742387328\" />Choose your own path to find all the endings, every level is different! Do you hate Spunk for destroying your precious Booty Slapper 6 game? Well hunt him down, give no mercy! Do you think he might be redeemed? Consider sparing him, maybe you can even be friends. Do you think there's something... deeper about all this? Well, trust your instincts and see where that takes you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/Secrets.png?t=1742387328\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/DanceGIFHD.gif?t=1742387328\" />Complete challenges, find collectables, and customize your trophy room! There are secrets galore! Hidden challenges to find and win! Loot to be found and stolen, I, uh, I mean collected! Take it all back to your home room to customize and decorate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/Options.png?t=1742387328\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727660/extras/DateGIFHD.gif?t=1742387328\" />F...Fall.. in love? I'm just kidding... unless?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Optional</strong> - Spank a booty?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p cla